# newsnow mcp服务器


官方MCP服务器 [NewsNow](https://github.com/ourongxing/newsnow)，40多个可用资源。

## 用法

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "newsnow": {
      "command": "npx",
      "args": [
        "-y",
        "newsnow-mcp-server"
      ],
      "env": {
        "BASE_URL": "https://newsnow.busiyi.world"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

